      "attributes": {
        "title": {
          "ja-ro": "Monster ga Afureru Sekai ni Natta kedo, Tayoreru Neko ga Iru kara Daijoubu desu"
        },
        "altTitles": [
          {
            "ja": "モンスターがあふれる世界になったけど、頼れる猫がいるから大丈夫です"
          },
          {
            "en": "The World is Full of Monsters, but With My Fluffy Feline Companion, I'll Be Okay"
          }
        ],
        "description": {
          "en": "The hit series \"The World Is Full of Monsters, So I Want to Live as I Wish\" is back with an official spin-off! \n\nThis time, the hero is the strongest cat around! Running parallel to the main story, the action moves to Kyushu with all-new boss monsters, skills, and mysteries waiting to be uncovered. If you love fantasy and post-apocalyptic survival, prepare for a purr-fectly wild new reverse-isekai adventure!"
        },
